# Blobs in this repo are LF. core.autocrlf=true on a Windows checkout rewrites
# the working tree to CRLF, which silently shifts every byte offset -- tests
# that slice a fixed window out of a source file then fail locally and pass in
# CI. Pin the working tree to LF so both agree.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
